# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored via `*.local`) only if the defaults are wrong for your machine.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* value at BUILD time, not at runtime: a bundle built without one has the
# default below baked in and cannot be repointed afterwards.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_BASE_URL — where `src/api.ts` sends everything. Include the `/api/v1` prefix, no trailing
# slash. Unset, it falls back to `/api/v1`, which is ROOT-RELATIVE and that is the point.
#
# The SPA and the API must be the same origin. The session's refresh token is an `httpOnly`,
# `Secure`, `SameSite=Strict` cookie scoped to the API's `/api/v1/auth` path (see
# `backend/EAMS.Api/Authentication/AuthCookies.cs`), and a cross-origin SPA cannot use one without
# the API opting into credentialed CORS — a wider hole than it closes.
#
#   - `npm run dev` — leave this unset. `vite.config.ts` proxies `/api` to the API host, so
#     http://localhost:5173/api/v1/... is served by the API and the browser treats the cookie as
#     first-party. Point the proxy elsewhere with VITE_DEV_API_TARGET below if your API is not on
#     :5080.
#   - IIS — the SPA and the API are sibling applications under one site, so set the API's virtual
#     path here. With the layout in `docs/DEPLOY-IIS.md` that is:
#       VITE_API_BASE_URL=/eamsapi/api/v1
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_DEV_API_TARGET — what `npm run dev` proxies `/api` to. Dev server only; it is not read by the
# build and never reaches the bundle. Defaults to the URL
# `dotnet run --project backend/EAMS.Api --urls "http://localhost:5080"` serves.
#
# VITE_DEV_API_TARGET=http://localhost:5080

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_BASE_URL — the URL prefix the built bundle is served from; it must match the IIS application's
# virtual path exactly. Defaults to `/` (the site root). A mismatch still serves index.html and 404s
# every asset, so the symptom is a blank white page rather than anything that names routing.
#
# VITE_BASE_URL=/eams/
